@startuml state-payment-lifecycle

title Futbolix — Payment Lifecycle (ST-02)

hide empty description

[*] --> PENDING : ReservationCreated consumed\n(idempotent by eventId — HU-PAY-002)

PENDING --> APPROVED : Wompi result "approved"\n[signature verified]\n/ publish PaymentApproved
PENDING --> REJECTED : Wompi result "rejected"\n[signature verified]\n/ publish PaymentRejected

APPROVED --> REFUNDED : ReservationCancelled consumed\n/ refund through Wompi (HU-PAY-005)

APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  Amount = court hourly price x hours,
  computed server-side by the reservation.
  A client-supplied amount is never trusted.
end note

note left of APPROVED
  Wompi Sandbox integration boundary:
  results enter only through the webhook
  handled by the payment-service ACL.
  Invalid signature: discarded, no transition,
  PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_INVALID logged.
  The same transaction result received twice
  causes one transition (unique wompi_transaction_id).
end note

note right of REFUNDED
  INV-002: PENDING never moves directly to REFUNDED.
  INV-003: only an APPROVED payment can be REFUNDED.
  Refund is in the MVP 2 pull list; Wompi Sandbox
  refund support is not documented (Q-007).
end note

@enduml
